{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-20","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：可公度量与比例与线段","englishTitle":"If a rational area be applied to a rational straight line, it produces as breadth a straight line rational and commensurable in length with the straight line to which it is applied.","book":10,"number":20,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.20","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.20/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":20,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-20@raw-0240103b471ff9ea","contentId":"euclid-10-20","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0240103b471ff9ea10486588766d7f7af00d62c63a6ae53eeb782407448888de","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-20.statement","euclid-10-20.construction.1","euclid-10-20.proof.1","euclid-10-20.proof.2","euclid-10-20.proof.3","euclid-10-20.proof.4","euclid-10-20.conclusion","euclid-10-20.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-20.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-20","revisionId":"euclid-10-20@raw-0240103b471ff9ea","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f7b6aee4359f38848a16b7aa747b790f979b49e9a6e86e2754cb802ce3455b08","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a rational area be applied to a rational straight line, it produces as breadth a straight line rational and commensurable in length with the straight line to which it is applied."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果对有理线段适用有理面积,则生成宽度为直线有理和长度可公度,其直线为直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-20.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-20","revisionId":"euclid-10-20@raw-0240103b471ff9ea","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2738de84dd34a4ff65fe18deeeb3ee4dbf88e2e64b712d062383e78e888f5aa2","citations":["euclid-10-def-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the rational area AC be applied to AB, a straight line once more rational in any of the aforesaid ways, producing BC as breadth; I say that BC is rational and commensurable in length with BA. For on AB let the square AD be described; therefore AD is rational. [[X. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将有理面积 AC电线应用于AB电线,在上述任何一条电线中,直线线将扩大BC电线,宽度扩大BC电线;我说,BC电线是有理电线,长度可公度电线是BA电线,AB电线是正方形 AD电线,因此,AD电线是有理电线。 [[X. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-20.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-20","revisionId":"euclid-10-20@raw-0240103b471ff9ea","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4ba29b87f46baee73f8f89ec30c8b08376b38f63230a6779389179833e413160","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AC is also rational; therefore DA is commensurable with AC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AC也是有理,因此DA就是可公度,AC就是AC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-20.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-20","revisionId":"euclid-10-20@raw-0240103b471ff9ea","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cc40b9ef6a7581ec9b051178d3339535878ab6f48b14f4bb78cf00edf5acf164","citations":["euclid-6-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as DA is to AC, so is DB to BC. [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DA比AC等于DB比BC；DA 与 AC 之比等于 DB 与 BC 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-20.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-20","revisionId":"euclid-10-20@raw-0240103b471ff9ea","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"466d56cc53e559f915fd42380fe335434546569ce10fd8a58674fe4b75627aeb","citations":["euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore DB is also commensurable with BC; [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)] and DB is equal to BA; therefore AB is also commensurable with BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,DB为可公度,BC;DB等于BA;AB等于可公度,BC。 [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-20.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-20","revisionId":"euclid-10-20@raw-0240103b471ff9ea","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"234984d14f67a1149b54ba273c2495e67f3f563bfd058c32d6b37e8321797f65","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AB is rational; therefore BC is also rational and commensurable in length with AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AB是有理,因此BC也是有理,长度可公度是AB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-20.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-20","revisionId":"euclid-10-20@raw-0240103b471ff9ea","order":6,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-20.source","contentId":"euclid-10-20","revisionId":"euclid-10-20@raw-0240103b471ff9ea","order":7,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"660734ae93b79e353822c4301ee32caf9b3ccfa875c82e6c4dd46b9fea6bf93d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.20/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.20\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-20:euclid-10-def-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-20","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-20.construction.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-def-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.20","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.20/","sourceLabel":"X. Def. 4"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-20:euclid-6-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-20","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-20.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.20","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.20/","sourceLabel":"VI. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-20:euclid-10-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-20","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-20.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.20","sourceUrl":"https: